stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RECEIVED

    RECEIVED --> REJECTED: No eligible store
    RECEIVED --> ALLOCATED: Store selected

    ALLOCATED --> CANCELLED: Cancel before picking
    ALLOCATED --> PICKING: Picking begins

    note right of ALLOCATED
        DELAYED_PROMISE is an independent condition flag.
    end note

    PICKING --> CANCELLED: Cancel before dispatch
    PICKING --> CANCELLED: Fulfilled value below 60 percent
    PICKING --> READY_FOR_DISPATCH: Picking completed

    READY_FOR_DISPATCH --> CANCELLED: Cancel before dispatch
    READY_FOR_DISPATCH --> DISPATCHED: Batch dispatched

    DISPATCHED --> CANCELLED: Post-dispatch cancellation handling
    DISPATCHED --> DELIVERED: Delivery recorded

    note right of DISPATCHED
        Refund eligibility and compensation depend on applicable business rules.
    end note

    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    DELIVERED --> [*]